  "question": {
    "text": "The modulation index for an A.M. wave having maximum and minimum peak to peak voltages of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mV</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mV</mi></math> respectively is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know, modulation index is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
